          "Career horoscopes help you organize whether your work is blocked by direction, timing, interpersonal friction, or resource allocation, but they cannot promise specific outcomes for promotions, job changes, or business ventures. When you feel lost at sea in the office, this kind of perspective can help clarify your current situation. For instance, sitting down at 9 AM to face an inbox full of emails without knowing where to start is a classic symptom of operational chaos.",
